WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.310
It's usually just us two.

2
00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:10.790
Theo's so boring, always reading at dinner
and shushing me.

3
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:12.500
Mom.

4
00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:15.160
At college, he's always glued to Lizzie.

5
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.810
Doesn't even spare us a glance.

6
00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:24.870
So, which one of you three is
going to be my son-in-law?

7
00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:28.440
Me?

8
00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:29.210
Mom!

9
00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:33.670
Writing letters to all your crushes
and then handing them over yourself?

10
00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.620
Theo, what the fuck is wrong with you?

11
00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:39.040
You better not fuck up your own life again.

12
00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:40.510
Hard decision, huh?

13
00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:52.500
Sending it was a mistake.

14
00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:56.430
Those feelings, they're
from a long time ago.

15
00:00:58.280 --> 00:00:59.230
Come here.

16
00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:07.340
Remember when you were a kid?

17
00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:09.900
You could never decide
which candy flavor to pick,

18
00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:12.750
even when you knew all that sugar
wasn't good for your teeth.

19
00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:16.280
Sometimes you just have to
stop overthinking every choice

20
00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:17.900
and let things unfold naturally.

21
00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:20.770
You don't have to figure
everything out tonight.

22
00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:24.600
Sometimes, it's not the
choices that imprison us,

23
00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:27.360
but our desire to make the perfect one.
